	<div id="content" class="mw-body" role="main">
		<aside id="wikigg-sl-header" data-mw="WggShowcaseLayout">
        <div
            class="wikigg-showcase__unit wikigg-showcase__reserved--lb"
            data-wgg-unit-type="internal"
        ></div>
</aside>

		<div class="content-body">
			<main>
				<a id="top"></a>
				<div id="siteNotice"></div>
				<div class="mw-indicators">
				</div>
				<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-main">We Meet Again!</span></h1>
				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
					<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Slay the Spire Wiki</div>
					<div id="contentSub"></div>
					<div id="contentSub2"></div>
					
					<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt" id="druid-container-1"><div><div class="druid-title">We Meet Again!</div></div><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-main-image"><a href="/wiki/File:Event-WeMeetAgain.png" class="image"><img alt="Event-WeMeetAgain.png" src="/images/Event-WeMeetAgain.png?81e51a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600" data-file-width="600" data-file-height="600" /></a></div></div></div>
<p><span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="We Meet Again!" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/We_Meet_Again!" title="We Meet Again!"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">We Meet Again!</a></span> is a shrine <a href="/wiki/Event" class="mw-redirect" title="Event">Event</a> found in all <a href="/wiki/Acts" title="Acts">Acts</a>.
</p><p>Shrine events appear less frequently than other events.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Options">Options</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/We_Meet_Again!?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Options" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/We_Meet_Again!?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Options"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<p><span class="frame-styling"><b>[Give Potion]</b></span> <span class="ts-negative">Lose a chosen potion.</span> <span class="ts-positive">Obtain a Relic.</span>
</p>
<ul><li>The event will randomly choose a potion upon entry and tell you which one was selected. You will be unable to drink or discard that potion until you leave the event's floor.</li></ul>
<p><span class="frame-styling"><b>[Give Gold]</b></span> <span class="ts-negative">Lose Gold.</span> <span class="ts-positive">Obtain a Relic.</span>
</p>
<ul><li>The amount of <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a> lost is between 50 and 150 (or your current amount of <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a>).</li></ul>
<p><span class="frame-styling"><b>[Give Card]</b></span> <span class="ts-negative">Lose a chosen card.</span> <span class="ts-positive">Obtain a Relic.</span>
</p>
<ul><li>The chosen card will not be <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?rarity=Basic"><span>Basic</span></a></span> or a <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Cards_List?type=Curse"><span>Curse</span></a></span>.</li></ul>
<p><span class="frame-styling"><b>[Attack]</b></span> Nothing happens.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Dialogue">Dialogue</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/We_Meet_Again!?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Dialogue" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/We_Meet_Again!?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Dialogue"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<blockquote><div style="font-style:italic">
<p>"We meet again!" <br />
A cheery disheveled fellow approaches you gleefully. You do not know this man. <br />
</p><p>"It's me! <span class="ts-gold">Ranwid!</span> Have any goods for me today? The usual? A fella like me can't make it alone, you know?" <br />
You eye him suspiciously and consider your options.
</p>
</div>
<blockquote>
<p><span class="frame-styling"><b>[Give Potion]</b></span>
</p>
<blockquote><div style="font-style:italic">
<p>"Exquisite! Was feeling parched." <br />
<span class="ts-blue ts-up"><span style="--i:0">Glup</span> <span style="--i:1">glup</span> <span style="--i:2">glup</span></span> <br />
</p><p>He downs the potion in one go and lets out a satisfied <span class="ts-shake"><span style="--i:0">burp.</span></span> <br />
</p>
</div></blockquote>
<p><span class="frame-styling"><b>[Give Gold]</b></span>
</p>
<blockquote><div style="font-style:italic">
<p>"Magnificent! This will be quite handy if I run into those <span class="ts-red">mask wearing hoodlums</span> again."
</p>
</div></blockquote>
<p><span class="frame-styling"><b>[Give Card]</b></span>
</p>
<blockquote><div style="font-style:italic">
<p>"Exemplary! I shall study this further in my chambers."
</p>
</div></blockquote>
<div style="font-style:italic">He rummages around in his various pockets... <br />
"Here, look what I've got for you today! Take it take it!"</div>
</blockquote>
<p><span class="frame-styling"><b>[Attack]</b></span>
</p>
<blockquote><div style="font-style:italic">
<p>"<span class="ts-shake"><span style="--i:0">Aaaaagghh!!</span></span> What a jerk you are sometimes!" <br />
He runs away.
</p>
</div></blockquote>
</blockquote>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Notes">Notes</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/We_Meet_Again!?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Notes" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/We_Meet_Again!?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Notes"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li>"<span class="ts-red">mask wearing hoodlums</span>" likely refers to the group of bandits in the Act 2 event <span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Masked Bandits" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Masked_Bandits" title="Masked Bandits"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Masked_Bandits" title="Masked Bandits">Masked Bandits</a></span>.</li></ul>
<p><br />
</p>
<div style="clear:both;" class=""></div>
